说出来。一瞬间，两人心中都涩涩的。“诸葛，对不起……”薛子皓看着诸葛明月的脸庞，咬了咬唇，有些无措的道着歉。心中暗想诸葛明月面上这样不在意，心中一定很痛苦。“诸葛，你没钱吃饭了我请你。”万俟辰拍着胸脯说道。“别说对不起了，对不起是没用的。”诸葛明月的脸色严肃起来，看着薛子皓沉声说道，“一句对不起是最为苍白无用的。当你做错事，不要想着口头上一句对不起来弥补。那样没任何意义。你要做的是用行为来弥补你的过失。”“是，我会的。”薛子皓的头点的像小鸡啄米，心中更为愧疚了。“所以，把你的钱袋交出来吧。买材料你全部付钱。”诸葛明月却噗的笑了出来，伸出手拍着万俟辰的肩膀，又补充道，“为了弥补我受伤的心灵，胖子请我吃饭。”“啊？”薛子皓和万俟辰一时没有回过神来，傻愣愣的看着诸葛明月。刚才还一幅难受的样子，现在这样，转变的太大了吧？这样的落差让他们一下转不过弯啊。“行了，我都没凄凄惨惨的悲痛，你们哀伤个什么劲？走走，买材料，然后吃饭。”诸葛明月脸上绽放出了灿烂的笑容来，看的薛子皓和万俟辰一阵愣神。“好，走，先买材料。我的零花钱全部贡献出来。”薛子皓掏出了钱袋，用力的晃了晃。“嗯，吃大餐庆祝我们通过考核！”万俟辰也双拳紧握，用力的点头。诸葛明月也笑起来点了点头，三人就往城里最大的商店走去了。到了商店，诸葛明月开始选材料，都选的是很基础的材料。这家商店，是苍枫城最大的商店了，老板是个中年男子，正懒洋洋的靠在柜台打瞌睡。看到有顾客来眼皮也没耷拉一下，而是哼唧了句：“随便看，随便选。东西都在这。”说完，就继续打瞌睡了。“切，一点也不热情。”万俟辰嘀咕着。诸葛明月没有多言，而是认真的挑选着材料，店里的服务员也是懒洋洋的样子，诸葛明月要什么，他只是打着呵欠给诸葛明月取出来，也不多言。买好了东西，结账的时候老板才睁开眼，算了下价格：“三个金币零七个铜币。”“喂，老板，还有七个铜币你也算啊？”薛子皓不满的开口了。“七个铜币又怎么了？不买算了。”老板斜了一眼薛子皓，冷淡的说道。薛子皓冷哼一声，很是不爽，但是还是掏钱付了材料。三人出了商店的大门，薛子皓摇晃着空荡荡的钱袋，叹气：“唉，这回我也穷了。这个老板真是抠门死，等着倒闭吧。”“那没办法啊，城里就这家的东西最齐全。”万俟辰摊手表示无奈。“不管了，东西买齐了，我先回家去了。炼制好了我给你啊。”诸葛明月提着一袋材料，就要急哄哄的往家里赶。“嗯。到时候学校里见。”薛子皓开口告别。“那个，不先吃饭么？”万俟辰弱弱开口。“对哦，先吃饭，我差点忘记了。我要吃肉！”诸葛明月这才想起来，之前他们似乎约好去吃大餐庆祝通过初级召唤师的考核的。她忙着回去炼制药剂，反倒是忘记这茬了。“清风楼，走走走！”胖子立刻兴奋起来，搓着手。“胖子，你有钱了啊？”薛子皓不怀好意的看着胖子。清风楼是苍枫城里面最好的一家酒楼了。“嘿嘿。”万俟辰嘿嘿一笑，拍了拍自己的钱袋，“我老爹奖励的，他对我有信心，知道我肯定通过考核，所以先把奖励给我了。”“这个月我就靠你了。”薛子皓摸着自己干瘪的钱袋说道。“没问题没问题。”万俟辰拍着胸脯说着。就这样一行三人来到了清风楼，直接上了二楼的包厢。万俟辰让诸葛明月点菜，诸葛明月老规矩，点的全是荤菜。点完了菜，三人闲聊起来。“过两天是我们低级班的学院去历练，你们知道的吧？”薛子皓问道。“知道。”诸葛明月点头。白羽学院经常都会举行这种历练，因为没有实践，理论再好也是无济于事。每次举行完召唤仪式后，就会举行这样的历练，考核学员的实力和应变能力。召唤仪式完毕后都会放三天假，一是让学员们去参加召唤师协会的考核，二是让学员们休整，三天后到学院就去参加历练了。“到时候我们三人一组啊！”万俟辰擦掌磨拳的说道，“这是我们第一次去参加这样的历练。争取拿到第一名。”“第一名又没好东西。”诸葛明月没好气的说道，“学院小气死了。”“这点我深表同感。”薛子皓用力点头。就在这个时候，门被敲响了，万俟辰说了声进来后，却是鱼贯而入十几个人，每个人的手上都端着清风楼的招牌菜，一一放在桌子上后，揭开盖子，色香味俱全的菜肴呈现出来，看起来让人垂涎不已。“看起来很好吃。”万俟辰点头。“闻起来也很香！”薛子皓也点头。“不过，问题是我们没点这么多。”诸葛明月做了总结，说完后看向了笑眯眯的店小二。“这些都是一位风度翩翩英俊潇洒英明神武玉树临风风流倜傥举世无双的公子，请这位小姐的。”店小二一口气背出一长串的形容词，都不带喘气的。诸葛明月三人嘴角直抽。“你形容的，是哪只？”诸葛明月嫌弃的问道。“正是在下。”一个清朗却带着一些魅惑的声音从门口传来。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－读者15392346973妹子，你好。你用手机看的，所以你看不到我给你的回复。故，我在这里给你回复。你是学生，先把学习方面的事弄好了，再看书啊。顺便，送了你800潇湘币，给你看书。总之，以学为主啊！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fuheikuangnu-qingchengzhaohuanshi/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 9 What are you looking at? Have you ever seen such a poor beauty? After leaving the gate of the association, they saw Wan Qichen showing off his medal to Xue Zihao. When the two saw Zhuge Mingyue coming out, they both approached and asked with concern: \"How is it? Have you passed?\" Zhuge Mingyue took out the medal and shook it: \"Of course you have passed. Now I have to go to the store to buy materials.\" \"Hey, are you making potions?\" Xue Zihao asked excitedly. \"Yes. Are you going?\" Zhuge Mingyue asked, and after thinking for a while, he said, \"Let me make it clear first that I don't have much money. If I make the medicine, I will sell it to you. I want to make money from you. However, if you pay for the materials, I won't make money from you.\" Xue Zihao and Wan Qichen looked at Zhuge Mingyue with wide eyes. \"What are you looking at? Have you never seen such a poor beauty?\" Zhuge Mingyue also stared back with wide eyes. \"You are so poor?\" Xue Zihao said in disbelief. \"I am the illegitimate daughter of the family and a disgrace to them. You have done your best to prevent me from starving to death. I spent all my food money to pay for the assessment. It's normal to have no money now, right? They didn't expect that I would take the summoner's assessment, so of course they didn't calculate the cost of the assessment.\" Zhuge Mingyue shrugged and said nonchalantly. However, after hearing this, Xue Zihao and Wan Qichen's expressions changed. They had never seen anyone say such an unspeakable thing so frankly. For a moment, both of them felt bitter in their hearts. \"Zhuge, I'm sorry...\" Xue Zihao looked at Zhuge Mingyue's face, bit his lip, and apologized somewhat helplessly. I secretly thought that Zhuge Mingyue must be very painful in his heart if he was so careless on the moon. \"Zhuge, if you don't have money to eat, I'll treat you.\" Wan Qichen said, patting his chest. \"Don't say sorry, sorry is useless.\" Zhuge Mingyue's face became serious, and she looked at Xue Zihao and said in a deep voice, \"A sorry is the most useless thing. When you do something wrong, don't think about making up for it with a verbal apology. That means nothing. What you have to do is to make up for your mistakes with actions.\" \"Yes, I will.\" Xue Zihao nodded like a chicken pecking at rice, feeling even more guilty. \"So, hand over your wallet. You pay for all the materials.\" Zhuge Mingyue burst out laughing, stretched out his hand to pat Wan Qichen's shoulder, and added, \"To make up for my wounded heart, Fatty invited me to dinner.\" \"Huh?\" Xue Zihao and Wan Qichen didn't come back to their senses for a moment, looking at Zhuge Mingyue in a daze. You looked uncomfortable just now, but now, the change is too big, right? Such a gap makes it difficult for them to turn around. \"Okay, I'm not miserable at all. Why are you mourning? Take a walk, buy materials, and then eat.\" A bright smile broke out on Zhuge Mingyue's face, and Xue Zihao and Wan Qichen were stunned for a while. \"Okay, let's go and buy the materials first. I will contribute all my pocket money.\" Xue Zihao took out his wallet and shook it vigorously. \"Well, let's have a big dinner to celebrate that we passed the exam!\" Wan Qichen also clenched his fists and nodded vigorously. Zhuge Mingyue also smiled and nodded, and the three of them walked to the largest store in the city. When he arrived at the store, Zhuge Mingyue began to choose materials, all of which were very basic. This store is the largest store in Cangfeng City. The owner is a middle-aged man who is lazily dozing off against the counter. When he saw a customer coming, he didn't even lower his eyelids. Instead, he muttered: \"Look at whatever you want, choose whatever you want. Everything is here.\" After that, he continued to doze off. \"Tch, not enthusiastic at all.\" Wan Qichen muttered. Zhuge Mingyue didn't say much, but carefully selected the ingredients. The waiter in the store also looked lazy. Whatever Zhuge Mingyue wanted, he just yawned and took it out for Zhuge Mingyue without saying much. After buying something, the boss opened his eyes when it was time to check out and calculated the price: \"Three gold coins and seven copper coins.\" \"Hey, boss, can you count the remaining seven copper coins?\" Xue Zihao said dissatisfied. \"What's wrong with seven copper coins? Forget it if you don't buy it.\" The boss glanced sideways at Xue Zihao and said coldly. Xue Zihao snorted, feeling very unhappy, but he still paid for the materials. The three of them walked out of the store. Xue Zihao shook his empty money bag and sighed: \"Oh, I'm poor this time too. This boss is really stingy. He's just waiting to go bankrupt.\" \"There's nothing you can do about it. This is the store with the most complete products in the city.\" Wan Qichen spread his hands to express his helplessness. \"No matter, I've bought everything. I'm going home first. I'll give it to you when it's refined.\" Zhuge Mingyue was carrying a bag of materials and was about to rush home. \"Okay. See you at school then.\" Xue Zihao said goodbye. \"Well, why don't you eat first?\" Wan Qichen said weakly. \"Yeah, let's eat first, I almost forgot. I want to eat meat!\" Zhuge Mingyue then remembered that they seemed to have made an appointment to have a big meal to celebrate passing the junior summoner examination. She was so busy going back to refine the potion that she forgot about it. \"Qingfeng Tower, let's go!\" The fat man immediately became excited and rubbed his hands. \"Fat man, are you rich?\" Xue Zihao looked at the fat man maliciously. Qingfeng Restaurant is the best restaurant in Cangfeng City. \"Hehe.\" Wan Qichen chuckled and patted his money bag, \"My father gave me the reward. He has confidence in me and knew that I would definitely pass the exam, so he gave me the reward first.\" \"I'm relying on you this month.\" Xue Zihao said, touching his shriveled money bag. \"No problem, no problem.\" Wan Qichen said, patting his chest. In this way, the three of them arrived at Qingfeng Building and went directly to the box on the second floor. Wan Qichen asked Zhuge Mingyue to order. Zhuge Mingyue followed the old rules and ordered only meat dishes. After ordering, the three of them chatted. \"In two days, our junior class will go to the academy to practice, you know, right?\" Xue Zihao asked. \"I know.\" Zhu", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}